than 20A house hold currents, and are toying with the idea of getting
their own 3-phase toys:

The symptom of "infant mortality" for a new breaker can be that
it explodes with the force of a hand grenade.  Professional Electricians
really do use "10 foot poles" to touch these under load, and stand
to the side, out of the potential blast zone.


