Brian,

FWIW: I have a ZLXp-L1 in my AlphaStation 255.  It uses GUBDRIVER.

The one big gotcha I ran into was that SYSTEM_CHECK must be zero.  The
driver has an IPL inversion somewhere that will bugcheck in DECW$REINIT
if checking is enabled.

